sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Citizen
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant App as Flask App
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Val as Validation Service
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant FS as File System (uploads)

    C->>UI: Open report form
    UI->>C: Render form (categories, locations)
    C->>UI: Fill category, description, location, photo
    C->>UI: Submit form
    UI->>App: POST /citizen/report (multipart)
    App->>Auth: Validate session / current_user
    Auth-->>App: Authenticated Citizen
    App->>Val: Validate fields + file (type, size <=5MB)
    Val-->>App: Validation OK
    App->>FS: Save uploaded image (safe filename)
    FS-->>App: image_path
    App->>DB: INSERT Report (user_id, category_id,<br/>location_id, description, image_path, status='Pending')
    App->>DB: Generate unique reference
    DB-->>App: report_id + reference
    App-->>UI: 200 + reference + acknowledgement
    UI->>C: Display confirmation with reference
